# operator must update VITE_V5_DRAW_MANAGER_ADDRESS and VITE_V5_CLAIM_MANAGER_ADDRESS on the
# Vercel `everdraw-v5-uat` project (dashboard env vars or `vercel env`), then trigger a redeploy
# of that project -- Vite bakes these in at build time, so pushing a commit or a manual
# `vercel --prod` re-run is required; setting the env var alone does not update the live bundle.
# VITE_V5_PRIZE_VAULT_ADDRESS and VITE_V5_TWAB_CONTROLLER_ADDRESS are UNCHANGED by this redeploy.
